A.b2y=new B.bJ(A.bb,"QUALITY","Under-extrusion","When the part has gaps or weak lines.",A.aGn,"Forcing the extruder through a clogged nozzle can damage gears, PTFE tube or motor.",A.vB,A.cK,null,null)
A.au4=s(["Check that belts are not loose or overly tight.","Confirm pulleys and grub screws are tight on the motor shafts.","Lower acceleration and print speed if movement is too aggressive.","Make sure cables, clips or printed parts do not collide with movement.","Clean rails or rods and lubricate only where the manufacturer recommends it."],t.s)
