A.qs=new B.a_(A.c7,["Academy","Maker Academy","Quick tips to maintain your printer and improve your parts.","Filament","Resin","TENKAI ACADEMY","View recommendation","Could not open the recommendation.","Tenkai Hub","News, community and ecosystem","Website","Policies, apps, betas and official news.","On the official website you can find information about the Tenkai Tenshi ecosystem, privacy policies, new applications, important links, future beta access, community updates and project news.","Maker Community","Join the official Tenkai Labs 3D group.","In the official group you can learn, share your creations, discover Tenkai Tenshi tools, follow launches, join beta campaigns and help improve future applications.","Tenkai Forge Suite","The complete version for makers and 3D businesses.","Tenkai Forge Suite is the advanced version of Tenkai Calculator 3D. It includes configurable filaments, printers, extras, clients, PDF quotes, cost analysis, finances, monthly reports, annual reports and more complete tools for managing 3D production.","More details","Open link","Close","TENKAI TENSHI ECOSYSTEM","Could not open the link."],t.w)
